$comment
Formaldehyde S1 excited-state opt+freq via TD-DFT.
B97-D/def2-SVP, 5 singlet roots, optimize on root 1 (n→π*).
CIS_STATE_DERIV = 1 selects root 1 for analytical-gradient excited-state
opt; the follow-up freq inherits the excited-state Hessian.
$end

$molecule
0 1
C    0.00000000   0.00000000  -0.52384100
O    0.30085383  -0.00000000   0.69806633
H    0.40450492   0.87365134  -0.99075545
H    0.40450492  -0.87365134  -0.99075545
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE          opt
   METHOD           b97-d
   BASIS            def2-SVP
   CIS_N_ROOTS      5
   CIS_SINGLETS     true
   CIS_TRIPLETS     false
   CIS_STATE_DERIV  1
$end

@@@

$molecule
   READ
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE          freq
   METHOD           b97-d
   BASIS            def2-SVP
   CIS_N_ROOTS      5
   CIS_SINGLETS     true
   CIS_TRIPLETS     false
   CIS_STATE_DERIV  1
$end
